WEBVTT

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.559
that when women negotiate
on behalf of others,

00:09:00.583 --> 00:09:02.601
the backlash vanishes.

00:09:02.625 --> 00:09:05.333
Now being tough is an act of caring.

00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.684
So when you negotiate,
think about who you're representing.

00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:12.851
It might be your family
who's depending on your salary.

00:09:12.875 --> 00:09:16.643
It could be your mentee
who will take the job after you.

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:19.601
For Grace, it was a group
she identified with.

00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:23.018
GS: I didn't want to be that statistic

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:25.393
of the woman that didn't ask.

00:09:25.417 --> 00:09:27.976
AG: Explaining who you're
representing makes it clear

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.518
that you're not being selfish.

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:31.518
It's called a relational account